OL,3,GNEWSARotary club to drive aid to
OL,4,AUkraine by ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rotary club's "most successful
OL,7,Fappeal" means an ambulance will be
OL,8,Fdelivering clothing and medical
OL,9,Fsupplies to front-line medics in
OL,10,FUkraine.
OL,12,FThe vehicle will leave Great
OL,13,FDoddington, near Wellingborough, in
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, on Sunday on a
OL,15,F1,355-mile (2,180-km) journey to Kyiv,
OL,16,Fwhere the aid will be given to charity
OL,17,FMother Ukraine, which will distribute
OL,18,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
