OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSARotary club to drive aid to
OL,4,AUkraine by ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trip has been made possible by The
OL,7,FRotary Club of Northampton Becket,
OL,8,Fwhich raised more than #5,000. It also
OL,9,Freceived generous donations from the
OL,10,Fpublic.
OL,12,F"It's ultimately about getting help and
OL,13,Faid to people who need it in their most
OL,14,Fdire circumstances and probably the
OL,15,Fworst time in their lives," said David
OL,16,FSmith, the club's chair.
